sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Test / CI
    participant S as rewind serve<br/>(uvicorn subprocess)
    participant C as client code
    participant D as rewind.db

    T->>S: spawn python -m rewind serve --port P
    Note over S: bind 127.0.0.1 P<br/>TraceStore point at db path<br/>install FastAPI app
    T->>C: _wait_for_health poll loop
    loop until /healthz 200
        C->>S: GET /healthz
        S-->>C: status ok
    end
    T->>C: build 3-span OpenInference request
    C->>S: POST /v1/traces protobuf
    S-->>C: 200 x-rewind-spans-accepted 3
    T->>D: open new TraceStore<br/>same db path
    T->>D: store.get_trace trace_id
    D-->>T: Trace 3 spans
    T->>T: assert parent linking round-trips<br/>assert hash_prompt == hash_source
